Case 2: \( | \cos(3\pi y) | < 1/4 \). Then, \( f(y) = 4(1/4 - | \cos(3\pi y) |) = 1 - 4 | \cos(3\pi y) | \).

So, we have two expressions for \( f(y) \) depending on the value of \( | \cos(3\pi y) | \).

